# ── Never publish: personal and device-identifying data ──────────────────────
# out/recon/     partition images incl. nvdata, nvcfg, protect1/2, persist,
#                proinfo — IMEI, RF calibration, DRM keys
# out/data-backup/  a full copy of the phone's /data
out/
work/
fw

# ── Never publish: vendor binaries ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Proprietary Xiaomi / MediaTek / Goodix blobs. Not ours to redistribute.
# Regenerate them from your own firmware with tools/extract-blobs.sh
device/xiaomi/warhol/prebuilt/*.img
device/xiaomi/warhol/prebuilt/dtb/*.dtb
device/xiaomi/warhol/prebuilt/touch_modules/*.ko
device/xiaomi/warhol/prebuilt/touch_firmware/*
device/xiaomi/warhol/recovery/root/vendor/firmware/*
device/xiaomi/warhol/recovery/root/lib/firmware/*
device/xiaomi/warhol/stock/

# ── Build scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tools/mkbootimg/
docker/scripts/damaged_projects.txt
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
